module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.a_published_credential_stands_in_for_the_one_still_owed

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { BelowCeiling, FoundBelowTheLadder, FoundOnRung, RecurringFailureMode, RungRead }
import gunbc.guarantee_rung { Mitigatable, StructurallyGuaranteed }
import gunbc.rung_climb { ClimbableButUnbuilt }

data a_published_credential_stands_in_for_the_one_still_owed: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "a_published_credential_stands_in_for_the_one_still_owed" as NonEmptyStr,

  rung: RungRead {
    found_at: FoundBelowTheLadder,
    standing: BelowCeiling {
      current: FoundOnRung { rung: Mitigatable },
      ceiling: StructurallyGuaranteed,
      blocker: ClimbableButUnbuilt,
      trigger_capability: "credential delivery modeled as a convergence over each credential's own read state -- absent, present, unread -- with readiness derived only from all of them being present, SUFFICIENT FOR no delivery order or one-shot step to be expressible as the thing that decides a card is ready",
    },
  },

  receipts: [
    "**two things a consumer needs are delivered once, in order, and the controller judges progress by the first -- so when the second fails, each side waits for the other.** INVALID STATE: the consumer has the first credential and waits for the second; the controller sees the first, assumes the consumer is proceeding, and waits for the consumer. HARM: a paid card that never serves until a deadline terminates it, and nothing records that anything is owed.",
    "SPECIMEN, gunbc#17108 at 7edc31fb (external review, 2026-11-27): gunbc.fleet.flex_aws_pass placed the card's certificate placeholder, then created its pool key, once, after the purchase. With the key write failed, the card published its certificate and waited for the key; the probe saw the certificate and probed /health, which the card does not serve before it has its key; and the purchase record -- the only memory of the delivery -- was closed as soon as EC2 listed the card.",
    "REPAIR: the two parameters are the record. Every pass reads both for every live card (gunbc.fleet.flex_aws_pass flex_aws_read_credentials) and creates whichever is absent on its own (flex_aws_deliveries); a card is probed only when both read back (flex_aws_probeable). Witnessed by test.claim.fleet.flex_aws_pass_witness a_card_with_its_certificate_and_no_key_is_given_the_key_and_then_probed.",
    "RUNG NOW: mitigatable, witnessed. CEILING: structurally guaranteed, with readiness typed on the delivery states.",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
